    "title": "From Snowmageddon to Knickerbocker: DC's historic snowstorms ranked - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jessica James ,\n9 hours ago WASHINGTON (7News) — We're bracing for a winter storm this weekend as some models call for the potential of 15 to 20 inches of snow in the D.C., Maryland and Virginia area. The DMV is no stranger to winter weather. The National Weather Service (NWS) has recorded data of snowstorms in our area starting back in 1772 to 2016. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
